{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2630","id":4679162958,"node_id":"PR_kwDOACGs6c8AAAABFuZcTg","html_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2630","diff_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2630.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tj/commander.js/pull/2630.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2630","number":2630,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: increment inspector port for --inspect-wait","user":{"login":"00200200","id":83299832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMjk5ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83299832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200","html_url":"https://github.com/00200200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\n\nExecutable subcommands already bump the Node inspector port so the child does not collide with the parent. That covers `--inspect` and `--inspect-brk`, but `--inspect-wait` is left as-is.\n\n```\nnode --inspect-wait app.js cache\n```\n\nThe child is spawned with the same `--inspect-wait` (port 9229). Node documents `--inspect-wait[=[host:]port]` the same way as `--inspect-brk`; the incrementer should treat it the same.\n\n## Solution\n\nRecognise `--inspect-wait` in `incrementNodeInspectorPort` and rewrite host/port the same way as `--inspect-brk`.\n\n- `--inspect-wait` → `--inspect-wait=127.0.0.1:9230`\n- `--inspect-wait=100` → `--inspect-wait=127.0.0.1:101`\n\n## ChangeLog\n\n- Fix: increment Node inspector port for `--inspect-wait` when spawning an executable subcommand","created_at":"2026-09-29T15:28:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T03:28:19Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T00:49:32Z","merged_at":"2026-09-30T00:49:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"130cf3a9d0dab501f295674166994b41982546a7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":1418520456,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE4NTIwNDU2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/labels/pending%20release","name":"pending release","color":"a7f9b6","default":false,"description":"Merged into a branch for a future release, but not released yet","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2630/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/2630/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/issues/2630/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tj/commander.js/statuses/feb835e8ff5e30203f16667e177875b57d3a0230","head":{"label":"00200200:bump-inspect-wait-port","ref":"bump-inspect-wait-port","sha":"feb835e8ff5e30203f16667e177875b57d3a0230","user":{"login":"00200200","id":83299832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMjk5ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83299832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200","html_url":"https://github.com/00200200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/00200200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.